<section class="telecom-principles">
<div><p class="eyebrow">HOW THIS SECTION WORKS</p><h2>Understand the system behind the call.</h2></div>
<div class="telecom-principle-copy"><p>Telecom is more than a protocol diagram. A working call depends on signalling, media paths, endpoint behaviour, routing policy, timing and operational visibility all agreeing at the same time.</p><p>These notes aim to separate standards from implementation details, explain trade-offs, and distinguish measured behaviour from assumptions. Project descriptions stay grounded in available evidence.</p></div>
